{"id":"4efe9928440240f9","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-mouse-operator.md","title":"ZFC Mouse Operator","display":"df-zfc-mouse-operator — ZFC Mouse Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-mouse-operator","aliases":["58-df-zfc-mouse-operator"],"display":"df-zfc-mouse-operator — ZFC Mouse Operator","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-model7-mouse.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-mouse-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-mouse-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-mouse-operator — ZFC Mouse Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"318a87851db7b127\" href=\"?note=318a87851db7b127\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-model7-mouse.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-model7-mouse.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in V\">\\(D\\in V\\)</span> (a set-sized domain of parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in V\">\\(F\\in V\\)</span> (the graph of a function with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Mouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Mouse}_S\\)</span> (mouse predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"318a87851db7b127\" href=\"?note=318a87851db7b127\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-model7-mouse.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-model7-mouse.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MouseOperator}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{MouseOperator}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (set-indexed mouse-operator predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}mouse\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{MouseOperator}_S(F,D) \\leftrightarrow F:D\\to\\operatorname{ran}(F)\\land \\forall x\\in D\\;\\exists M\\,\\exists\\vec E\\;\\bigl(F(x)=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\land x\\in M\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Mouse}_S(F(x))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}mouse\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{MouseOperator}_S(F,D) \\leftrightarrow F:D\\to\\operatorname{ran}(F)\\land \\forall x\\in D\\;\\exists M\\,\\exists\\vec E\\;\\bigl(F(x)=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\land x\\in M\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Mouse}_S(F(x))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the set-sized restriction of a mouse operator: every parameter is contained in the carrier of the mouse assigned to it.</li>\n<li>A proper-class mouse operator is represented in ZFC by the schema asserting this predicate for every set-sized domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>; the definition therefore does not quantify over a nonexistent set-valued map into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-model7-mouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"318a87851db7b127","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-model7-mouse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-model7-mouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"318a87851db7b127","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Mouse}_S$ (mouse predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-model7-mouse.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Mouse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MouseOperator}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}mouse\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{MouseOperator}_S(F,D) \\leftrightarrow F:D\\to\\operatorname{ran}(F)\\land \\forall x\\in D\\;\\exists M\\,\\exists\\vec E\\;\\bigl(F(x)=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\land x\\in M\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Mouse}_S(F(x))\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1321,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2829","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-mouse-operator.md|58-df-zfc-mouse-operator]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","318a87851db7b127"]}